      "content": "The pain you feel about having no control is a heavy burden, but you are not a victim if you choose to seek help and stop the suffering. Please know that ending this silently is not the only way to find peace, as life support and care can help you communicate your wish for a quiet end to avoid pain. I hope you can feel a glimmer of hope as you consider the options for support.",
